    "allReviewed": true,
    "observations": [
      "Training repairs some missing or fragmented synthetic cells and reduces printed-paper interior errors; dense stripes/dots can still overwhelm the learned classifier.",
      "The learned real-photo masks retain straight edges and many thin features but add obvious false seams and islands to the plain cat. Star and hummingbird also gain noise. These errors are visible before fitting.",
      "Printed stripes/dots, trees and lettering are still treated as cuts on several real photos. Some floral ink is suppressed. The already-good red-tree/blue-snowflake frame remains good; it is not a new gain.",
      "Mother/child, repeated hearts and dinosaur become self-mask passes relative to native RGB; cat, heart-checkerboard and hummingbird lose passes. Some gains change solver routing or cut counts and do not establish a single causal search mechanism.",
      "The wrong basket and reflective-building crops remain wrong. All six unresolved crops remain in the denominator.",
      "The printed central flower still passes fitting against a mistaken cutting mask. No classifier is selected or accepted solely for low self-mask error."
    ]
  },
